---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Fini's Kitchens"
  description="Learn more about Fini's Kitchens, the origin of the business, and the experience behind the people leading it."
  eyebrow="Who we are"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__copy">
          <h2 class="section-head__title">Part of the Fini Group</h2>
          <p class="section-head__desc">
            We’re part of the wider Fini Group, offering services built around care, practical improvement and meaningful
            work through our professional passions: kitchen renovations, cleaning services and software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="grid grid--2 about-grid">
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="muted">
            Fini’s Kitchens exists to create spaces that feel good to live in, not just spaces that look good in photos.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">
            From design through to installation, we focus on layout, function, flow and the small details that make a
            kitchen easier to use every day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="media media--1x1 about-media">
          <div class="about-placeholder">Team photo</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__copy">
          <h2 class="section-head__title">The origin of the business</h2>
          <p class="section-head__desc">
            Fini’s Kitchens was built from something deeply personal - and from a decision to create something meaningful,
            lasting and full of care.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="origin-card card card--surface">
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="muted">
            The heart behind the business matters, but the full story deserves its own space. If you’d like to understand
            where Fini’s Kitchens began and why the work means so much, you can read it here.
          </p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/the-love-that-stays">Read the full story</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__copy">
          <h2 class="section-head__title">Leadership</h2>
          <p class="section-head__desc">
            A small team with a strong mix of design, operations and business oversight.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="grid grid--3 team-grid">
        <article class="card card--surface team">
          <div class="team__avatar">
            <img
              class="team__avatar-image"
              src="/images/OW.jpeg"
              alt="Portrait of Oli Wyatt"
              width="72"
              height="72"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <h3>Oli Wyatt</h3>
          <p class="faint team__role">CEO & Designer</p>
          <p class="muted">Design, delivery and commercial leadership.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card card--surface team">
          <div class="team__avatar">
            <img
              class="team__avatar-image"
              src="/images/VN.png"
              alt="Portrait of Viki Nasch"
              width="72"
              height="72"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <h3>Viki Nasch</h3>
          <p class="faint team__role">COO</p>
          <p class="muted">The Brains</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <div class="section-head__copy">
          <h2 class="section-head__title">About the owner, CEO & creator</h2>
          <p class="section-head__desc">
            Fini’s Kitchens is led by Oli Wyatt, whose career spans kitchen design, contract delivery, sales, operations
            and commercial leadership across the industry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="grid grid--2 about-grid">
        <article class="card card--surface founder-card">
          <div class="founder-card__top">
            <div class="team__avatar founder-card__avatar">
              <img
                class="team__avatar-image"
                src="/images/OW.jpeg"
                alt="Portrait of Oli Wyatt"
                width="96"
                height="96"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="stack stack--tight">
              <h3>Oli Wyatt</h3>
              <p class="faint team__role">Owner, CEO & Creator</p>
              <p class="muted">
                With nearly two decades in the kitchen industry, Oli brings a rare mix of creative design thinking,
                technical understanding and real-world delivery experience.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stack founder-summary">
            <p class="muted">
              His background covers kitchen design, social housing, private developer projects, contract management,
              process improvement, sales and commercial leadership. That breadth gives him a practical view of what makes
              a kitchen work - not just visually, but in budget, buildability, function and day-to-day life.
            </p>

            <p class="muted">
              Rather than approaching projects from only one angle, Oli understands the full journey: how a space should
              feel, how it needs to perform, and what it takes to deliver it well.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card card--surface confidence-card">
          <h3>Why clients can feel confident</h3>

          <div class="confidence-list">
            <div class="confidence-item">
              <strong>Deep industry experience</strong>
              <p class="muted">
                Nearly 20 years spent inside the kitchen sector, from design roles through to senior commercial and
                contract leadership.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="confidence-item">
              <strong>Design backed by delivery knowledge</strong>
              <p class="muted">
                Ideas are shaped by real understanding of surveying, specifications, cost control, workflow and how
                projects actually move on site.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="confidence-item">
              <strong>Broad perspective across project types</strong>
              <p class="muted">
                Experience across private contracts, developer work, social housing and contract environments brings a
                balanced, practical approach to each kitchen.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="confidence-item">
              <strong>Commercial clarity</strong>
              <p class="muted">
                Strong commercial and operational experience helps keep decisions grounded, communication clearer and
                expectations realistic.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid { margin-top: var(--space-8); align-items: center; }

  .about-media {
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-2);
  }

  .about-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--c-text-faint);
    border: 1px dashed var(--c-border-strong);
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
  }

  .origin-card {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .team { text-align: center; }

  .team__avatar {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }

  .founder-card__avatar {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .team__avatar-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
  }

  .team__role { margin-top: var(--space-2); }

  .founder-card,
  .confidence-card {
    height: 100%;
  }

  .founder-card__top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .founder-summary {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .confidence-list {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .confidence-item strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .confidence-item p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .founder-card__top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .founder-card__avatar {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>